# {{ ui_title | default('ABI') }} 🐝

Chat interface for your ABI agent, powered by [Chainlit](https://docs.chainlit.io).

This UI is a thin client over your agent's `/stream` (SSE) endpoint. It opens a
framework-managed session so multi-turn conversations stay coherent.

## Run it

This UI has no app code of its own — it runs `abi_core.ui.chainlit_app`,
the framework's canonical Chainlit client (see the `Dockerfile`, or run it
directly outside Docker):

```bash
pip install "abi-core-ai[ui]"
abi-core ui chainlit --url {{ agent_url | default('http://localhost:8083') }} --title "{{ ui_title | default('ABI') }}"
```
